    "isNew": false,
    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Przypisywanie za pomocą operatorów",
    "descriptionContent": "Dowiedz się, jak używać operatorów +=, -=, ++ i --.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17312,
        "title": "Operatory przypisania",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146656,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ponieważ przypisanie do siebie to potężne narzędzie do tworzenia gier, poznajmy kilka operatorów, które pomagają szybciej pisać kod.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146657,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wiemy, że możemy dodać <code>1</code> do zmiennej, zapisując nazwę zmiennej. W tym przypadku jest to <code>score</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score = score + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146658,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zamiast ponownie zapisywać nazwę zmiennej, możemy użyć operatora <code>+=</code>, aby dodać liczbę za pomocą <code>score += 1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>score</code>, następnie <code>+=</code> i na końcu <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146659,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby odjąć wartość od zmiennej, używamy operatora <code>-=</code>, tak jak tutaj, gdzie zmniejszamy <code>health</code> o <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"health -= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146660,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Operator inkrementacji</strong>, <code>++</code>, umieszczony po nazwie zmiennej, zwiększa jej wartość o <code>1</code>. W tym przypadku <code>coins++</code> zwiększy wartość z <code>5</code> do <code>6</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coins = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"coins++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(coins);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>coins</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146661,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możemy odjąć <code>1</code> od wartości zmiennej za pomocą <strong>operatora dekrementacji</strong> ( <code>--</code> ), tak jak tutaj w przypadku <code>lives--</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"lives++\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lives = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lives--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lives);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>lives--</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146662,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arrows = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"arrows += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arrows);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>8</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146663,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakiego operatora używamy do odejmowania liczby od wartości zmiennej?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146664,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Który operator zwiększa wartość zmiennej o jeden?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerSpeed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerSpeed--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerSpeed);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>199</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj dziesięć do wartości zmiennej za pomocą operatora <code>+=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" xp = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"xp += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(xp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>xp</code>, następnie <code>+</code>, a potem <code>=</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Odejmij 200 od wartości zmiennej za pomocą operatora <code>-=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mana = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mana -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(mana);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>-=</code>, a następnie <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 146668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zwiększ wartość zmiennej <code>ammo</code> o jeden.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ammo + 2\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ammo++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>ammo</code>, następnie <code>+</code> i na końcu <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 146669,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj operatora dekrementacji <code>--</code>, aby zmniejszyć liczbę nabojów o jeden.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ammo = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ammo--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ammo);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>ammo--</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}